meta {
  name: Shell badge counters
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/badges
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  ~X-Act-On-Tenant: 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
  res.body.data: isDefined
}

docs {
  `GET /v1/badges`

  Counters for the app shell (waitlist, pending expenses, unassigned/urgent chats); each present only with its capability. No query params.

  - **Auth:** Bearer access token (`{{accessToken}}`, set by `auth/Login`)
  - **Listeners:** internal
  - **Success:** `200`; `data` has `waitlist`, `pendingExpenses`, `unassignedChats`, `urgentChats`
  - **Header `X-Act-On-Tenant`**: Platform staff only: act on this tenant (uuid) or * for all tenants (read-only).
}
